{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105099","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105099/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105099/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105099/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105099","id":2975007457,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6RiV7E","number":105099,"title":"Fix caching of objects' class name pointer in `Object` instances.","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-04-06T15:00:45Z","updated_at":"2025-04-08T18:54:37Z","closed_at":"2025-04-08T17:46:51Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105099","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105099","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105099.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105099.patch","merged_at":"2025-04-08T17:46:51Z"},"body":"`Object` instances have a field called `_class_name_ptr` intended to cache accesses of their class names.\r\nThis field has been broken for a while now: It is temporarily set during `_initialize` and then reset to `null` again. This substantially decreased efficiency of the `get_class_name` function.\r\n\r\nIn actuality, `_initialize` is called only from `postinitialize_handler`, and the corresponding `ClassDB::creator`. It is never called from a constructor. For this reason, resetting the pointer was not needed.\r\nI also made it not inline, which decreases the binary size by ~0.5mb. Since surrounding logic is more complex, this will likely not have detrimental performance impact.\r\n\r\nWith the `_class_name_ptr` guaranteed to be set (after construction anyway), `get_class` can just use it to return its string buffer instead of allocating a new one. This will substantially speed up calls of this function. In addition, a virtual function can be removed from `Object` and `GDCLASS`.\r\n\r\nFinally, I took the opportunity to remove `get_parent_class_static`, in favour of a `supertype` declaration. This allows deduplication of the corresponding logic.\r\n\r\n## Benchmark\r\n\r\nI measured an unsubstantial 1% improvement in editor launch time (within measurement error):\r\n```\r\n ❯ hyperfine -m25 -iw1 \"bin/godot.macos.editor.arm64.master --path /Users/lukas/dev/godot/empty-game --editor --quit\" \"bin/godot.macos.editor.arm64 --path /Users/lukas/dev/godot/empty-game --editor --quit\"\r\nBenchmark 1: bin/godot.macos.editor.arm64.master --path /Users/lukas/dev/godot/empty-game --editor --quit\r\n  Time (mean ± σ):      3.136 s ±  0.135 s    [User: 2.477 s, System: 0.351 s]\r\n  Range (min … max):    2.958 s …  3.432 s    25 runs\r\n\r\nBenchmark 2: bin/godot.macos.editor.arm64 --path /Users/lukas/dev/godot/empty-game --editor --quit\r\n  Time (mean ± σ):      3.115 s ±  0.134 s    [User: 2.473 s, System: 0.347 s]\r\n  Range (min … max):    2.952 s …  3.432 s    25 runs\r\n\r\nSummary\r\n  bin/godot.macos.editor.arm64 --path /Users/lukas/dev/godot/empty-game --editor --quit ran\r\n    1.01 ± 0.06 times faster than bin/godot.macos.editor.arm64.master --path /Users/lukas/dev/godot/empty-game --editor --quit\r\n```","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105099/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":4},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/i